{"3578920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shadow of the Nameless", "steam_appid": 3578920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN THE PLAYTEST!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We are looking for brave souls to test our combat and extraction mechanics. </strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Hit the 'Request Access' button above to get notified as soon as the gates open!</strong> <i>Adding the game to your <strong>Wishlist</strong> also helps us immensely to bring more content to the game.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/97d5c897f08f7edfcbc44d66b2c051c8.poster.avif?t=1769982055\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/97d5c897f08f7edfcbc44d66b2c051c8.webm?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/97d5c897f08f7edfcbc44d66b2c051c8.mp4?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Extraction:</strong> Decide when to leave. Will you escape now with your loot, or risk everything for the power of the Abyss?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Class System:</strong> Customize your hero to fit your playstyle. Every run unlocks new skill combinations and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Atmosphere:</strong> Explore hand-crafted yet unpredictable realms filled with secrets, monstrous horrors, and epic boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Progression:</strong> Death is a harsh teacher. Learn from your failures, upgrade your arsenal, and prepare for the next descent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/9793135b9959f63af4eb54e55236b9f2.poster.avif?t=1769982055\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/9793135b9959f63af4eb54e55236b9f2.webm?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/9793135b9959f63af4eb54e55236b9f2.mp4?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Class System:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warrior</strong> – Master brute force or become an unbreakable bastion. Skill trees let you rage-fueled berserkers or shield-bearing commanders. <br><strong>Ranger</strong> – Stalk prey with poison-tipped arrows or dominate the battlefield with deployable traps. <br><strong>Wizard</strong> – Wield raw elemental storms or delve into hexes that corrupt foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class evolves through <strong>sanctuary upgrades</strong>, blending traditional roles with dark-fantasy twists. Customize further via faction gear and hybrid perks. <i>Become legend - or something entirely new.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/0c8d20a72715cc1a53695c4e68800bba.poster.avif?t=1769982055\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/0c8d20a72715cc1a53695c4e68800bba.webm?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/0c8d20a72715cc1a53695c4e68800bba.mp4?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world is dying. Your sanctuary is the last spark. Will you reignite it - or loot its ashes?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/72cf5f37bf2b9fb1f92ef224947bc317.poster.avif?t=1769982055\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/72cf5f37bf2b9fb1f92ef224947bc317.webm?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/72cf5f37bf2b9fb1f92ef224947bc317.mp4?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN THE PLAYTEST!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We are looking for brave souls to test our combat and extraction mechanics. </strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Hit the 'Request Access' button above to get notified as soon as the gates open!</strong> <i>Adding the game to your <strong>Wishlist</strong> also helps us immensely to bring more content to the game.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/97d5c897f08f7edfcbc44d66b2c051c8.poster.avif?t=1769982055\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/97d5c897f08f7edfcbc44d66b2c051c8.webm?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/97d5c897f08f7edfcbc44d66b2c051c8.mp4?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Extraction:</strong> Decide when to leave. Will you escape now with your loot, or risk everything for the power of the Abyss?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Class System:</strong> Customize your hero to fit your playstyle. Every run unlocks new skill combinations and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Atmosphere:</strong> Explore hand-crafted yet unpredictable realms filled with secrets, monstrous horrors, and epic boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Progression:</strong> Death is a harsh teacher. Learn from your failures, upgrade your arsenal, and prepare for the next descent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/9793135b9959f63af4eb54e55236b9f2.poster.avif?t=1769982055\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/9793135b9959f63af4eb54e55236b9f2.webm?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/9793135b9959f63af4eb54e55236b9f2.mp4?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Class System:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warrior</strong> – Master brute force or become an unbreakable bastion. Skill trees let you rage-fueled berserkers or shield-bearing commanders. <br><strong>Ranger</strong> – Stalk prey with poison-tipped arrows or dominate the battlefield with deployable traps. <br><strong>Wizard</strong> – Wield raw elemental storms or delve into hexes that corrupt foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class evolves through <strong>sanctuary upgrades</strong>, blending traditional roles with dark-fantasy twists. Customize further via faction gear and hybrid perks. <i>Become legend - or something entirely new.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/0c8d20a72715cc1a53695c4e68800bba.poster.avif?t=1769982055\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/0c8d20a72715cc1a53695c4e68800bba.webm?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/0c8d20a72715cc1a53695c4e68800bba.mp4?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world is dying. Your sanctuary is the last spark. Will you reignite it - or loot its ashes?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/72cf5f37bf2b9fb1f92ef224947bc317.poster.avif?t=1769982055\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/72cf5f37bf2b9fb1f92ef224947bc317.webm?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/extras/72cf5f37bf2b9fb1f92ef224947bc317.mp4?t=1769982055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Survive and extract in a fractured dark fantasy roguelite. Master a dynamic class system, scavenge for rare resources, and conquer monstrous horrors. Every run is a choice: deepen your descent into the abyss or escape with your life and loot.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/ee72132fc770f7cf793ae015ba17373eb5f97a38/header.jpg?t=1769982055", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578920/96ca0ea09f